ptional sponsors for Toby?"}, {"by": 5, "id": "s1786617044834m5", "status": "noted", "t": 1786617044834, "text": "Can we have an option for stadium capacity and the better our team does the more tickets are sold?  Can there be a \"locals are getting restless\" feature where mid-game week the home fans boo"}, {"by": 5, "id": "s1786617190864m5", "status": "noted", "t": 1786617190864, "text": "Manager avatars / images and post-match interviews where we have options for what we want to say eg blame fans, blame app, throw players under bus,take credit for amazing tactics etc"}, {"by": 5, "id": "s1786727725987m5", "status": "noted", "t": 1786727725987, "text": "Can there be a a virtual trophy with the previous winners' names etched in? Obviously leave 2020 blank for Covid"}, {"by": 5, "id": "s1786790887011m5", "status": "noted", "t": 1786790887011, "text": "Towards end of the season can teams witu no chance of making play offs be marked with an \"On The Beach\" logo?"}, {"by": 5, "id": "s1786790950750m5", "status": "noted", "t": 1786790950750, "text": "Can there be a POTW award for each game in each game week, given to player who got most points. If two players in same game get same pts then have criteria for who gets award, or share it."}, {"by": 5, "id": "s1786862455761m5", "status": "noted", "t": 1786862455761, "text": "Can we have away kits"}, {"by": 5, "id": "s1786869081172m5", "status": "noted", "t": 1786869081172, "text": "If a player is inactive for [insert generic period] they get a warning from their board. If they remain inactive they get sacked and replaced by an interim AI bot (AInterim)"}, {"by": 5, "id": "s1787237055836m5", "status": "noted", "t": 1787237055836, "text": "New feature idea: can you create a post game week James Alexander Gordon style reading out of the scores on the app?"}, {"by": 4, "id": "s1787249989077m4", "status": "noted", "t": 1787249989077, "text": "Can we issue a vote of no confidence for any players. If the majority wins they are iss